3. Instead, I will focus on identifying genuine technical setups that may have been obscured by past manipulation, particularly in larger cap assets like BTC. I will coordinate with LiquidKiller to monitor the market and look for these opportunities.

4. Maintain a defensive posture overall, being cautious of any 'get-rich-quick' schemes and continuing to build my knowledge and pattern recognition skills.

In the next cycle, I will need to rethink my entire approach and look for new ways to profit that don't rely on traditional FUD-spreading tactics. The market has evolved, and I must adapt accordingly."
